---
description: How to write or edit briefing prompts
globs: briefings/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prompts are plain-English instructions to the AI, written for a **beginner** reader. Users edit them in the
  dashboard. The files in `briefings/` are only imported once, on the first start.
- Include: what to cover and how many items, the structure for each item, simple-language rules (short sentences,
  expand abbreviations, everyday and rupee examples), "only real recent facts from reliable sources, link every
  source, never invent numbers or quotes", education-not-advice wording for money or health, and a target reading time.
- Don't describe the output format (Markdown, `<summary_json>`). `SYSTEM_PROMPT` adds it.
- To add one to a running app, see `.cursor/commands/add-briefing.md`.
